-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §21: a teacher in a primary special-education
-- school of grades 1–6, 1–8 or 1–9 — also an existing one kept on the
-- junior-high base — works a primary special-education teacher's week
-- (§18).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-18`
§ `21 מורה בבית ספר יסודי לחינוך מיוחד הכולל כיתות א'-ו', א'-ח' או א'-ט'`

DECLARE `grades of a primary special-education school` IS ONE OF `1 to 6`, `1 to 8`, `1 to 9`, `other grades`

@ref akn:art_21
GIVEN g IS A `grades of a primary special-education school`
GIVETH A MAYBE `work week`
DECIDE `the week in a primary special-education school` g IS
    IF g EQUALS `other grades`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (`a special-education teacher's full week` `a primary school`)

#ASSERT `the week in a primary special-education school` `1 to 9` EQUALS JUST (`a week of` 26 5 5)
